  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="4a0fc636-2658-5058-850d-83ce614044a1" activityNameId="c97e7550-67f2-5ad8-8323-b4c076fe24de" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, oil combustion, in cogen with ignition gas engine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, oil combustion, in cogen with ignition gas engine
This dataset needs to be combined with the datasets for the biogas and diesel input, the emissions from the biogas combustion and the infrastrucure expenditures in order to establish the multi-output process which provides the products electricity and heat from cogeneration.;
UUID: 17d7af2c-9760-3c83-ade4-de7f661a1aca
Use of diesel in a cogeneration unit. Included are emissions to air, as well as use and disposal of operational supplements. Excluded are the consumption of biogas and diesel, the emissions due to the combustion of biogas, and infrastructure expenditures.
Location: Emissions and efficiencies adjusted to Swiss emission regulation (LRV, Luftreinhalteverordnung) valid in year 2000.
Technology: 50 kWhel lean burn engine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_17d7af2c-9760-3c83-ade4-de7f661a1aca.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
